{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and fight through the Acri forest and discover the secret to it's high concentration of magic! Learn new spells and find secrets while adventuring deeper towards the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acri ushered\u00a0in a new age of peace between the 5 Covens, It's naturally high mana content made it\u00a0hallowed ground, For most it seemed like a return to the Evergreen Era- Communication and Collaboration bred by proximity. Isn't it wonderful...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Action Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different spells to learn and cast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Unique Areas to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Boss Fights\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets To Discover\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Drastically Harder New Game+</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Message</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Howdy! I'm Volpanic! I pretty much made everything for the game! Except the backgrounds- check out ricenoodlebrain on instagram they did the amazing background work, Oh and the actual art for all the Steam stuff as well!!! Greenhouse: Schism is a game I've tried to make a few times... In fact I have, this is technically a remake I suppose. Thank you for being interested enough in the game to read through this admittedly meager description, Wishlist it iffen ya want otherwise thanks for stopping by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mothin Flawless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496980/b7d076489423973d06332d72557d54cc0b8061ed.jpg"},{"name":"Mothin Flawless Plus!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496980/ed82e3811e69ab0ef6f1243558c8696fa53ae663.jpg"},{"name":"Anise Flawless","path":"https